<mxfile><diagram id="diff" name="diff"><mxGraphModel grid="0" page="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="notes" value="WF-04 Demo scenarios: 36 thay đổi. Xanh lá = thêm · Đỏ = xoá · Vàng cam = đổi; phần còn lại làm mờ.&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Close testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Upload file version → Sync file version&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Enter result → Enter result with snapshot unit and LOD/LOQ&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Enter conclusion → Assess exact type limit: pass, fail or insufficient basis&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04a Main: result approved, file version signed → DS-04a Main: result approved, file version signed ↔ WF-04 main path&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Retest → Retest with a new booking&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep rejected result; open a new testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Close testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04b Head rejects the result → DS-04b Head rejects the result ↔ WF-04-E1&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign and send → Enter result with snapshot unit and LOD/LOQ&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Show warning → Show warning; keep it on the result&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Send anyway → Sign and send anyway&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Keep warning → Close testing task&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04c Unusual result warning → DS-04c Unusual result warning ↔ WF-04-E2&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04d Test cannot be done → DS-04d Test cannot be done ↔ WF-04-E3&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign file version” → system activity “Complete sample” → activity “Sign file version” → activity “Enter result with snapshot unit and LOD/LOQ”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Reject with reason” → notification “✉ Notify tester” → activity “Reject with reason” → system activity “Keep rejected result; open a new testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign and send” → notification “✉ Notify head” → activity “Sign and send” → system activity “Close testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Upload file version” → activity “Enter result” → system activity “Sync file version” → activity “Sign file version”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: system activity “Back up local file” → ◉ activity final “Both versions kept” → system activity “Back up local file” → activity “Save changes again”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Close testing task” → notification “✉ Notify head”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Keep rejected result; open a new testing task” → notification “✉ Notify tester”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm system activity “Close testing task” → notification “✉ Notify head”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Save changes again” → ◉ activity final “Both versions kept; changes saved again”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Sign and send” → notification “✉ Notify head” → activity “Sign and send” → system activity “Close testing task”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi đầu cạnh: activity “Approve result” → activity “Sign file version” → activity “Approve result” → system activity “Complete sample”&lt;br&gt;• Thêm activity “Save changes again”&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04e Same file changed on two computers → DS-04e Same file changed on two computers ↔ WF-04-E4&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Tester&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Both versions kept → Both versions kept; changes saved again&lt;br&gt;• Đổi lane: System → Tester&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Upload new version → Sync file version&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Sign version → Sign file version&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04f Head rejects a file version → DS-04f Head rejects a file version ↔ WF-04-E5&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: Upload file version → Sync file version&lt;br&gt;• Đổi nhãn: DS-04g Online editing service down → DS-04g Online editing service down ↔ WF-04-E6" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=17;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#111827;"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="2420" height="978" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="cap_l" value="Trước" vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSiz